Non Functional Requirement:
- Unit test
	- Component test (E2E within service)
	- user case unit test (orchrestrator)
	- service/domain unit test (function)
	- repository unit test (integration)

- Swagger for API Document /api-docs
- How to start service
- Clean architecture and dependency injection
- DB: PosgresQLGiven: API Service has following configuration
- Rest API Spec

Create Product    POST /product
    BODY {
        name: string,           
        description: string(nullable),           
        sale_price: double (nullable),
        price: double,
    }
    Response {
        successful: bool,
        error_code: "string",
        data: null | {
            data1: "string"
            data2: "string"
        }
    }
Patch product รองรับการส่งเข้ามาเฉพาะ field ที่ต้องการแก้ไขและเขียนทับเฉพาะ field นั้น    PATCH /product/{id}
    BODY {
        name: string (allow undefined),                      
        description: string(allow undefined,nullable),                      
        sale_price: double (allow undefined, nullable),
        price: double(allow undefined),
    }
    Response {
        successful: bool,
        error_code: "string",
    }
